OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786614496
OL,3,CUK economy grew by 0.4% between April
OL,4,Cand June, ONS reveals
OL,6,FThe UK economy grew by 0.4% between
OL,7,FApril and June, according to the ONS,
OL,8,Fbut Treasury officials warn the
OL,9,Feconomy may not grow at all next year
OL,10,Fif conflict around the Strait of
OL,11,FHormuz continues to affect trade.
OL,13,FThe growth had been predicted by a
OL,14,Fconsensus of economists, and follows a
OL,15,Frise of 0.6% in GDP for the first
OL,16,Fthree months of 2026.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
