SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786614496
OL,3,CUK economy grew by 0.4% between April
OL,4,Cand June, ONS reveals
OL,6,FDirector of Economic Statistics for
OL,7,Fthe ONS, Liz McKeown, said: "Growth
OL,8,Fslowed in the second quarter of the
OL,9,Fyear, following a strong start to
OL,10,F2026, but remained relatively robust.
OL,12,F"Services were once again the main
OL,13,Fdriver of growth, while production was
OL,14,Fbroadly unchanged and construction
OL,15,Falso grew."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
