PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786614496
OL,3,CUK economy grew by 0.4% between April
OL,4,Cand June, ONS reveals
OL,6,FSpeaking prior to the announcement,
OL,7,FRob Wood, chief UK economist for
OL,8,FPantheon Macroeconomics, said this
OL,9,Fwould show "the big picture is that
OL,10,Fthe economy has remained resilient to
OL,11,Fthe hit from the war in Iran".
OL,13,FThe services sector ` the most
OL,14,Fdominant in the UK economy `
OL,15,Fstrengthened in May, largely coming
OL,16,Ffrom professional services and
OL,17,Fscientific research and development.
OL,26,@qD@LOUsD@]O]
