CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786614496
OL,3,CUK economy grew by 0.4% between April
OL,4,Cand June, ONS reveals
OL,6,FFurthermore, recent data has pointed
OL,7,Fto factories and manufacturing firms
OL,8,Fstockpiling in anticipation of supply
OL,9,Fshortages and price rises, which has
OL,10,Fhelped keep growth elevated.
OL,12,FBut a weaker picture may be emerging
OL,13,Ffrom June as the heatwaves bring mixed
OL,14,Fresults for businesses and some
OL,15,Findustries come under increasing
OL,16,Fpressure, economists said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
