OL,3,CUK economy grew by 0.4% between April
OL,4,Cand June, ONS reveals
OL,6,FThomas Pugh, chief economist for RSM
OL,7,FUK, said he was expecting the services
OL,8,Findustry to have been dragged down by
OL,9,Fa fall in hospitality activity,
OL,10,Fdespite the Fifa World Cup kicking off
OL,11,Fin June.
OL,13,FMr Pugh said its own business surveys
OL,14,Fsuggest "consumers were likely
OL,15,Fswitching away from restaurants
OL,16,Ftowards pubs to watch the World Cup,
OL,17,Frather than increasing the total
OL,18,Famount of spending".
OL,26,@vD@IOUzD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
