CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786614496
OL,3,CUK economy grew by 0.4% between April
OL,4,Cand June, ONS reveals
OL,6,FBut he added: "There could still be a
OL,7,Fboost to activity in July, given the
OL,8,Fscorching weather and England reaching
OL,9,Fthe semi-finals."
OL,11,FGrowth could be set to slow into next
OL,12,Fyear however, with internal modelling
OL,13,Ffrom the Treasury suggesting UK GDP
OL,14,Fcould see growth as low as 0.3% in
OL,15,F2027, government sources have said.
OL,17,FOfficials have said they routinely
OL,18,Fplan for all possible scenarios, with
OL,19,Fthis growth projection linked to a
OL,20,Fmore extreme situation.
OL,26,@nD@OOUqD@QO]
