OL,3,CUK economy grew by 0.4% between April
OL,4,Cand June, ONS reveals
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, modelling shown to the
OL,7,Fprime minister and chancellor, first
OL,8,Freported by Bloomberg, said the UK
OL,9,Feconomy could grow by 0.9% this year
OL,10,Fif there is no permanent peace deal
OL,11,Fbetween the US-Israeli forces and Iran.
OL,13,FThis would miss the 1.1% prediction
OL,14,Ffrom the OBR earlier this year. The
OL,15,FOBR had also predicted 1.6% GDP growth
OL,16,Fin 2027.
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
