OL,3,CUK economy grew by 0.4% between April
OL,4,Cand June, ONS reveals
OL,6,FThe more extreme scenario also
OL,7,Findicated that Consumer Price Index
OL,8,F(CPI) inflation could peak at 4.3% in
OL,9,Fthe first quarter of next year, with
OL,10,Fdisruption in the Strait of Hormuz
OL,11,Flikely to keep oil and gas prices
OL,12,Felevated.
OL,14,FIn response to the latest economic
OL,15,Fgrowth data, Chancellor of the
OL,16,FExchequer John Healey said: "I know
OL,17,Fpeople are worried about the impact of
OL,18,Fthe conflict in the Middle East on
OL,19,Ftheir cost of living, which has been
OL,20,Ftoo high for too long and it has added
OL,21,Fpressure on British businesses.
