OL,3,CUK economy grew by 0.4% between April
OL,4,Cand June, ONS reveals
OL,6,F"This is an active, hands-on
OL,7,Fgovernment, putting British interests
OL,8,Ffirst ` giving breathing space to
OL,9,Fthose feeling the strain, making our
OL,10,Fcountry more resilient and bringing
OL,11,Fhope back.
OL,13,F"We've seen the fastest growth in the
OL,14,FG7 this year, but we now need to
OL,15,Fdouble down and drive growth in every
OL,16,Fpostcode."
OL,18,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,19,Four political experts are across all
OL,20,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
